# File-change approvals: a new workspace file (auto-approved), a write into .rozu/ (denied by
# policy), a legacy patch outside the workspace (the user), a delete (destructive: the user), and
# an approval for an item rozu never saw (denied by default).
< turn/start
> {"id":__ID__,"result":{"turn":{"id":"turn_1","items":[],"status":"inProgress"}}}
> {"method":"item/started","params":{"item":{"type":"fileChange","id":"fc_1","changes":[{"path":"notes.md","kind":{"type":"add"},"diff":"+hello\n"}],"status":"inProgress"},"startedAtMs":1,"threadId":"thr_1","turnId":"turn_1"}}
> {"id":"srv-1","method":"item/fileChange/requestApproval","params":{"itemId":"fc_1","threadId":"thr_1","turnId":"turn_1","startedAtMs":2}}
